  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Styrke 00 Classes left today Overview Free trial Menu \u203a Timetable \u203a Classes \u203a Coaches \u203a Memberships \u203a Personal training \u203a Journal \u203a Overview \u203a About \u203a FAQ \u203a Contact \u203a Free trial Today Open now Hours Mon\u2013Fri 06\u201322 Sat\u2013Sun 08\u201318 Find us N\u00f8rrebrogade 88 2200 Copenhagen N Desk +45 33 12 88 00 [email protected] Follow Instagram Strava Spotify Start a free week Since 2019 N\u00f8rrebrogade 88, Copenhagen Built for strength An independent strength studio on N\u00f8rrebrogade, run by the coaches who teach in it. Our story One coach, two racks and a rule: every member gets coached, every session. 2019 Freja opens the doors with two racks, one rower and twelve members. 2020 Mateo joins. Kettlebells and evening strength go on the timetable. 2021 The studio room opens for mobility and pilates, with Giulia. 2022 Sofia starts teaching vinyasa. The first waiting list. 2023 We take the unit next door: 640 square metres, turf and a sauna. What we believe Four rules we have kept since the first day, and plan to keep. 01 Coaching over equipment A good coach with a barbell beats a room full of machines. We spend on people first. 02 Small groups Classes are capped so a coach can watch every rep. ",
